	(text "200R on ILIMIT is 2A max current, change resistor to change\nthe cutoff current, graph on pg 12 of datasheet\n\nN/C on DVDT is 0.9V/ms, can put a capacitor from \nDVDT to ground to change slew rate (pg 12)\n"
